&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Salesforce developers and IT to implement enhancements, troubleshoot issues, and optimize performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams to translate business needs into scalable technical solutions within the Salesforce ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimization &amp;amp; Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement of our PSA solution, including backlog grooming, feature releases, and system upgrades.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with stakeholders across Professional Services, Finance, and Operations to gather feedback, prioritize enhancements, and ensure the system aligns with evolving business needs.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support UAT and change management activities for new features and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor usage and adoption metrics; deliver enablement and support to users across professional services teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document configurations, SOPs, and best practices to support scaling and knowledge transfer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills / Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years experience in a Certinia or Salesforce systems administration, business systems analyst or development role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years experience building flows, automation, and customizations within Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of database software or relational database theory and ability to query using SQL, SOQL, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to explain technical concepts to non-technical personnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of project management, resource planning, timekeeping, and billing processes in a professional services environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working independently and in a fast-paced, cross-functional environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills / Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce Certified Administrator, Advanced Administrator, Platform Developer I, or other Salesforce certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior Experience with Git or Github.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience with Certinia or similar PSA tool.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior Experience with Salesforce development (e.g., Apex, Lightning Web Components) a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
